{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Play as the Growmancer, a wizard traveling worlds with his canine companion to transform wastelands into fertile grounds and battle destructive wildfires. Upgrade both via a skill tree. Challenge yourself or just relax.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the Growmancer, a mysterious sorcerer dedicated to greening barren worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747676027\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress through an expansive skill tree to unlock potent abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747676027\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Summon steadfast allies to assist in nurturing these new worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747676027\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...And defend vibrant ecosystems from destructive wildfires!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/4-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1747676027\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What Awaits You:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Growmancer:</strong> Embody a wizard journeying through devastated worlds, transforming them into blooming gardens and controlling destructive wildfires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loyal Canine Companion:</strong> Your faithful dog assistant on your travels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Incremental Upgrades:</strong> Collect flowers and invest them in a skill tree, unlocking improvements for both the Growmancer and your dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong> Land transformation, fighting wildfires, resource gathering, and ability upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adjustable Difficulty:</strong> Choose between a relaxing experience or a challenge demanding intense focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Elements of Random Generation:</strong> Ensuring variety across multiple playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Playtime:</strong> Approximately 2 hours for a single playthrough, but countless hours for those looking to replay, achieve 100% of achievements, or aim for higher scores.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690720?t=1747676027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690720?t=1747676027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/623a93a70844f135b6a7d265ade787161f9622df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747676027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/623a93a70844f135b6a7d265ade787161f9622df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747676027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3740260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Play as the Growmancer, a wizard traveling worlds with his canine companion to transform wastelands into fertile grounds and battle destructive wildfires. Upgrade both via a skill tree. Challenge yourself or just relax.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the Growmancer, a mysterious sorcerer dedicated to greening barren worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/1-ezgif.com-optimize.g